击·浮潜幻海\n拥有【迷离】时，重击替换为浮潜幻海，造成湮灭伤害，并进入蜃境状态。若当前已处于蜃境状态，施放浮潜幻海不会重新进入蜃境状态。\n可在水中施放。\n \n空中攻击\n消耗耐力进行空中下落攻击，造成湮灭伤害。\n \n闪避反击\n成功闪避后一定时间内短按普攻，将会攻击目标，造成湮灭伤害。","descEn":"Basic Attack\nPerform up to 3 consecutive attacks, dealing Havoc DMG.\n \nHeavy Attack\nConsume STA to attack the target, dealing Havoc DMG.\n \nHeavy Attack - Delusive Dive\nWhen Cantarella has Trance, Heavy Attack becomes Delusive Dive, dealing Havoc DMG to the target, and then Cantarella enters Mirage. While in Mirage, casting Delusive Dive does not activate Mirage again.\nCan be cast in water.\n \nMid-air Attack\nConsume STA to perform Plunging Attack, dealing Havoc DMG.\n \nDodge Counter\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} Normal Attack right after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing Havoc DMG.","params":[{"label":"第一段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 1 DMG","values":["40.00%","43.28%","46.56%","51.16%","54.44%","58.21%","63.46%","68.70%","73.95%","79.53%"]},{"label":"第二段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 2 DMG","values":["18.33%*4","19.83%*4","21.34%*4","23.44%*4","24.94%*4","26.67%*4","29.07%*4","31.48%*4","33.88%*4","36.44%*4"]},{"label":"第三段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 3 DMG","values":["36.50%*2","39.50%*2","42.49%*2","46.68%*2","49.67%*2","53.12%*2","57.90%*2","62.69%*2","67.48%*2","72.57%*2"]},{"label":"重击伤害","labelEn":"Heavy Attack DMG","values":["28.76%*2","31.12%*2","33.48%*2","36.78%*2","39.14%*2","41.85%*2","45.63%*2","49.40%*2","53.17%*2","57.18%*2"]},{"label":"浮潜幻海伤害","labelEn":"Delusive Dive DMG","values":["26.68%*2","28.87%*2","31.06%*2","34.12%*2","36.31%*2","38.83%*2","42.33%*2","45.83%*2","49.33%*2","53.05%*2"]},{"label":"空中攻击伤害","labelEn":"Mid-air Attack DMG","values":["21.12%+31.68%","22.86%+34.28%","24.59%+36.88%","27.01%+40.52%","28.75%+43.12%","30.74%+46.10%","33.51%+50.26%","36.28%+54.42%","39.05%+58.57%","41.99%+62.99%"]},{"label":"闪避反击伤害","labelEn":"Dodge Counter DMG","values":["26.66%*4","28.85%*4","31.04%*4","34.10%*4","36.28%*4","38.80%*4","42.30%*4","45.79%*4","49.29%*4","53.01%*4"]},{"l