nds the target into Hazy Dream. The DMG Multiplier of Jolt triggered by Cantarella is increased by 245%.","params":["245%"],"buffIds":[1607000002],"addProp":[]},{"index":3,"name":"凝视着深渊","nameEn":"Gaze into the Abyss","desc":"共鸣解放陷溺的伤害倍率提升370%。施放共鸣解放陷溺后，直接进入蜃境状态。若当前已处于蜃境状态，施放共鸣解放陷溺不会重复进入。","descEn":"The DMG Multiplier of Resonance Liberation Flowing Suffocation is increased by 370%. After casting Resonance Liberation Flowing Suffocation, enter into Mirage. If already in Mirage, casting Resonance Liberation Flowing Suffocation does not activate the Mirage state again.","params":["370%"],"buffIds":[1607000003],"addProp":[]},{"index":4,"name":"就像凝视自己的灵魂","nameEn":"Behold Your Own Soul","desc":"蜃境状态期间，治疗效果加成提升25%。","descEn":"When in Mirage, Healing Bonus is increased by 25%.","params":["25%"],"buffIds":[1607000004,1607554001],"addProp":[]},{"index":5,"name":"投到倒影的怀里","nameEn":"Rest in Your Reflection","desc":"共鸣解放弥漫的织梦水母的最大召唤数增加5。","descEn":"The maximum number of Dreamweavers Cantarella can summon through Resonance Liberation Diffusion is increased by 5.","params":["5"],"buffIds":[1607000005],"addProp":[]},{"index":6,"name":"下坠、下坠……坠入更深的幻梦","nameEn":"Fall, Fall... and Fall Deeper into the Dream","desc":"普攻蛰幻的伤害倍率提升80%。施放共鸣解放陷溺时，坎特蕾拉的伤害无视目标30%防御，持续10秒。\n迷梦的前1.2秒，目标受到伤害时，若此次伤害没有附加迷梦，则目标不会触发惊醒。","descEn":"Increase the DMG Multiplier of Basic Attack Phantom Sting by 80%. Casting Resonance Liberation Flowing Suffocation makes Cantarella's DMG ignore 30% of the target's DEF for 10s.\nFor the first 1.2s of Hazy Dream, when the target takes an instance of DMG that does not inflict Hazy Dream, Jolt will not be triggered on the target.","params":["80%","30%","10","1.2"],"buffIds":[1607000006,1607556001],"addProp":[]}],"avatar":"assets/avatars/1607.webp?v=8b47f4552fc6"}}